    <node id="Covid19">
      <data key="d0">Covid19</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Covid19, a global pandemic caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus, has become a major global health crisis. The disease was first identified in Wuhan, China in December 2019 and has since spread globally, resulting in widespread illness and death. The SARS-CoV-2 virus has been the target of various vaccines and treatments, including the Pfizer-BioNTech vaccine, which was designed to prevent the spread of the virus.

The disease caused by SARS-CoV-2 is attributed to the virus itself, which has resulted in significant public health concerns worldwide. In some cases, patients infected with the virus have exhibited symptoms such as delirium, in addition to the typical respiratory symptoms. The global pandemic has been classified as a major health crisis by the World Health Organization (WHO), and has resulted in significant economic and social disruption worldwide.

Covid19 can also be referred to by other names, including Coronavirus disease 2019, an infectious disease caused by SARS-CoV-2, as well as a severe viral respiratory disease caused by the same virus. Furthermore, the disease indication specified for patients and clinical case reports often involves Covid19, further underscoring the widespread impact of the SARS-CoV-2 virus.

The SARS-CoV-2 virus has been characterized as contagious and airborne, causing respiratory symptoms in infected patients. The pandemic caused by this virus has resulted in a complex and multifaceted global health crisis with far-reaching consequences for public health and society. Various vaccines and treatments have been developed to prevent the spread of the virus, including the Pfizer-BioNTech vaccine.

It is worth noting that the term Covid19 can refer to the pandemic caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus, as well as the disease itself caused by the virus. Additionally, the disease has been referred to by other names, including Novel coronavirus disease causing severe respiratory syndrome. However, it is clear that the pandemic has had a significant impact on global health and society, and has resulted in widespread illness and death.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition caused by the Coronaivirus, the pandemic occurred in year 2020 and more.&lt;SEP&gt;An infectious disease caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus.&lt;SEP&gt;Covid-19 is a global pandemic caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3b02ad23c5895936b3c0b71851649c2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6a5889e2c77746885a05d3aeb6ed5e4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b5c3d014d26e07b37236ea91978fa49-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2bab568fd0945ca97229932b3958ca4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e31462b2b61662a5cdda18b771b6a9fe-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-df05bfef1a077e0155db5a2319d2e5ed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d80c32250bbbf7ad55cf221040fa307-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95ac51e5947b5b1fb36826322f42f310-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7060f720f9ba041c95cc7423476c26f6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82d7afa230de1929c75d7a1ae481a664-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-409a49e99d7838aa055c73cca5cc3731-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ae74db97de9299ba839d02b2fb047120-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-936f3c0323bd4447ee7bbc89993bf6ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6fac4d0ace145ccea7831fee370c35-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c64194b27f68aaa72cdd59bdab53127-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d6b43f294f7182a81a8f52320634abb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9119ecde5d1c7cc671aaff07c77ee2e1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95b580a63c7343d8b7f976e925b74120-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-99344a0282b93f21f96885a4d6804355-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cd200d4caaaecdb4624319bee02b76c5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b99c4c782b43e8dd210d981201a8a953-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8faeb94ce116f4335d47a4477fb5a990-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ecce322107159be253436bffad4f7f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ab176aa592a8ca65da80ba579c42d79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b3d902b1975b05b77d807a4a3e76d22d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4301fdd6d220edec2508fe3ab73d329f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fcfa57204c968485db6ce958a32798b1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba679de338676145ac42d51c4033cdd5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9da2af97eccd3fa32f10c928182ea713-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4d80759040f52b3ede49f42699d78ee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ef76abe0052f290f4f25188fbc72ce38-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-64461aee1df8d8614f176b6b66640954-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6be885e2ac421cdf4adeacfd81d4896a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f41dbcd0ad3671a2ac5da13460b3f44-chun