    <node id="patient">
      <data key="d0">patient</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">**Patient**

The patient is an individual receiving medical treatment or care for various health conditions. They can refer to any human individual experiencing symptoms such as fever, cough, shortness of breath, and dermatitis herpetiformis lesions on the skin and perioral area, particularly after being infected with COVID-19. In some instances, patients may be pregnant and contract COVID-19, resulting in complete resolution of the disease six months after delivery.

Patients may also be undergoing treatment for other conditions, such as acute myocarditis, septic emboli, multifocal abscesses, and thrombocytopenia. They may require specialized care, such as swallowing therapy, to address specific health concerns. One patient, who received a COVID-19 mRNA vaccination, is currently undergoing treatment, but there is no indication that the vaccination is directly related to their current treatment or condition.

Medical procedures such as hospitalization may be necessary for conditions like meningitis and hyponatremia. In one case, a male patient undergoing anti-TB treatment reported physical condition issues, which were resolved after adjusting medication dosages. The patient's immunological status is unclear due to insufficient evidence, but they may be followed up for a certain period to monitor their condition and presenting symptoms.

The patient's condition is often closely followed up, with symptoms monitored over a period of time. In one instance, a patient began a 6-week course of oral voriconazole with close clinical and radiological surveillance, and their symptoms were closely monitored over a 15-week period. The patient's condition was closely followed up, and their symptoms resolved in this time frame. Overall, the patient is considered an individual receiving medical care or treatment, with a wide range of health concerns and treatment options reflected in the various descriptions.

Note that there are no conflicts or inconsistencies in the descriptions that would require separate summaries for distinct entities or relationships. The provided descriptions generally align with the concept of a patient receiving medical treatment or care, and the length of the summary remains within the token limit of 600.&lt;SEP&gt;A female patient experiencing symptoms of thyrotoxicosis, with a Burch-Wartofsky score of 35, and laboratory results indicating elevated levels of total T4, free T4, and total T3.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual undergoing treatment for hydatid disease.&lt;SEP&gt;A person undergoing surgery and experiencing respiratory issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cd00db0ae9ecbe44b58bb940c8d22e91-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f9c970bb217606784f35fb18a674f8a4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6a5889e2c77746885a05d3aeb6ed5e4a-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cd24aad1fdc5de922a50ab7953f43a3f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7060f720f9ba041c95cc7423476c26f6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7060f720f9ba041c95cc7423476c26f6-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82d7afa230de1929c75d7a1ae481a664-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82d7afa230de1929c75d7a1ae481a664-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-82d7afa230de1929c75d7a1ae481a664-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e2af8011ab47c55dd96b1f453c4d299-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9830f31d51c915a5d63cd25e5ee2876c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ddb189d08becfbc31626442a6e6080f1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ddb189d08becfbc31626442a6e6080f1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f020ad0a2c0ecdec4208d99f1323b71a-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c64194b27f68aaa72cdd59bdab53127-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a6b1da4c7da3290d7d05a67bc6887c2b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37b86b5550564c8fffdac9d2aa3847fa-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eb60a9a94338d8cb72e8be2c77c851d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ecce322107159be253436bffad4f7f3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4389b6cb92af87d5a04e2441adde5d99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4389b6cb92af87d5a04e2441adde5d99-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67fd22a190eacc0568e9819986f6c1fb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8e81c2beca3c37ea5e8eb28df0ada85d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e6ad227758be9acc011baf12582f069-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-03b0a8dfeb808417cea94ea14849fbdf-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5bdb1a3963218454e869ba51d8709816-chunk-002</data>
