    <node id="Remdesivir">
      <data key="d0">Remdesivir</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Antiviral medication Remdesivir is used to treat COVID-19, a viral infection caused by the SARS-CoV-2 virus. Remdesivir was administered to a patient, and it is effective in treating viral infections. The patient received remdesivir medication, which is an antiviral medication used for the treatment of COVID-19. Remdesivir is used as part of the treatment regimen for COVID-19, and it is an antiviral medication used to target the SARS-CoV-2 virus. Remdesivir was originally developed for use against other viral infections, but it has been repurposed for the treatment of COVID-19.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-6a5889e2c77746885a05d3aeb6ed5e4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e31462b2b61662a5cdda18b771b6a9fe-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95ac51e5947b5b1fb36826322f42f310-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95ac51e5947b5b1fb36826322f42f310-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-95ac51e5947b5b1fb36826322f42f310-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a6b1da4c7da3290d7d05a67bc6887c2b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-20bba48c069ffccbeda48a1c9126ecab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5bdb1a3963218454e869ba51d8709816-chunk-000</data>
