    <node id="Front Med (Lausanne)">
      <data key="d0">Front Med (Lausanne)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Front Med (Lausanne) is a peer-reviewed open-access scientific journal published by the Frontiers editorial office. This journal is based in Lausanne, Switzerland, and focuses on publishing high-quality research papers in the field of medicine. It serves as the source journal for clinical case reports, providing a platform for the publication of case reports and research articles on various medical topics. With a strong emphasis on peer review, the journal ensures the quality and validity of the research it publishes, making it a reputable source for medical professionals and researchers. The journal's articles cover a wide range of medical topics, contributing to the advancement of medical knowledge and practice.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cd24aad1fdc5de922a50ab7953f43a3f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3fe52622b806c3dde023d8b421f5077a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-049ea1a9ce8bf1994b5a4f69969915b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e6fac4d0ace145ccea7831fee370c35-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3e3f3c4d8f66d7495a702536a1895bbb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a4cac2addca2717d86125cd3a997e5bd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7c64194b27f68aaa72cdd59bdab53127-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a6b1da4c7da3290d7d05a67bc6887c2b-chunk-000</data>
