    <node id="CRP">
      <data key="d0">CRP</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">CRP, or C-Reactive Protein, is a protein that rises in response to inflammation or infection. It is a biomarker used to measure inflammation levels in the body. 

In the clinical evaluation of a patient's condition, CRP serves as a blood marker, providing valuable information about the patient's inflammatory state. This makes it a crucial tool in the assessment and management of various inflammatory conditions. Furthermore, CRP is used as a factor in creating subgroups, considering its characteristic of being affected by the treatment selection for COVID-19 patients.

As an inflammation marker, CRP helps in identifying the level of inflammation in the body. Its measurement through a blood test is a common practice in medical settings to diagnose and monitor inflammatory diseases. Overall, CRP plays a significant role in understanding and managing inflammatory conditions, highlighting its importance in both diagnosis and treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of protein found in the blood whose levels are often elevated during inflammation or infection.&lt;SEP&gt;C-reactive protein, a biomarker for inflammation&lt;SEP&gt;A laboratory test used to measure C-reactive protein, which is elevated in response to inflammation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-397d75bf96c654d226460be3bdf675fd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f20b43850bf66bd2b3a28373aa471cc9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eb60a9a94338d8cb72e8be2c77c851d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eb60a9a94338d8cb72e8be2c77c851d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eb60a9a94338d8cb72e8be2c77c851d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b3d902b1975b05b77d807a4a3e76d22d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b3d902b1975b05b77d807a4a3e76d22d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea8bc1e08bf193a9e2d5cfe0cfa7cb03-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea8bc1e08bf193a9e2d5cfe0cfa7cb03-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f14a7f62e056d22fda25084ef5245cb4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-08b0574b124b4b202cf913a692661565-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5bdb1a3963218454e869ba51d8709816-chunk-000</data>
