      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The AIAN populations in Arizona have experienced a disproportionate impact from COVID-19, with 25% of AIAN deaths in the U.S. occurring in Arizona (1,596 out of 6,382) and 8-10% of COVID-19 deaths in the state, despite being 5% of the total population.</data>
