      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Minddistrict is an eMental health platform that provides modules for various user groups, including both patients and caregivers.&lt;SEP&gt;Provides mental healthcare services and education for caregivers through exercises, videos, and text fragments about caregiver burden and balance.&lt;SEP&gt;Minddistrict is a company developing self-help modules for informal caregivers.&lt;SEP&gt;Minddistrict developed the self-help module Terug in balans (voor naasten).</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-ba679de338676145ac42d51c4033cdd5-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba679de338676145ac42d51c4033cdd5-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba679de338676145ac42d51c4033cdd5-chunk-003</data>
